{"fps": 30, "frames": 1575, "beats": [{"a": 0, "b": 164, "text": "The world's most famous economist beat the market only after he quit forecasting it.", "words": [{"w": "The", "f": 8, "e": 14}, {"w": "world's", "f": 14, "e": 27}, {"w": "most", "f": 28, "e": 36}, {"w": "famous", "f": 37, "e": 48}, {"w": "economist", "f": 49, "e": 65}, {"w": "beat", "f": 66, "e": 74}, {"w": "the", "f": 74, "e": 81}, {"w": "market", "f": 81, "e": 93}, {"w": "only", "f": 93, "e": 101}, {"w": "after", "f": 102, "e": 111}, {"w": "he", "f": 112, "e": 117}, {"w": "quit", "f": 117, "e": 125}, {"w": "forecasting", "f": 126, "e": 146}, {"w": "it.", "f": 146, "e": 153}]}, {"a": 164, "b": 286, "text": "Imagine you're John Maynard Keynes, Cambridge, nineteen twenty-one.", "words": [{"w": "Imagine", "f": 166, "e": 179}, {"w": "you're", "f": 179, "e": 191}, {"w": "John", "f": 191, "e": 199}, {"w": "Maynard", "f": 200, "e": 212}, {"w": "Keynes,", "f": 213, "e": 226}, {"w": "Cambridge,", "f": 226, "e": 244}, {"w": "nineteen", "f": 245, "e": 259}, {"w": "twenty-one.", "f": 260, "e": 279}]}, {"a": 286, "b": 366, "text": "King's College hands you its money to invest.", "words": [{"w": "King's", "f": 288, "e": 299}, {"w": "College", "f": 299, "e": 311}, {"w": "hands", "f": 312, "e": 320}, {"w": "you", "f": 321, "e": 326}, {"w": "its", "f": 327, "e": 332}, {"w": "money", "f": 333, "e": 342}, {"w": "to", "f": 342, "e": 346}, {"w": "invest.", "f": 347, "e": 359}]}, {"a": 366, "b": 505, "text": "Your plan: predict the business cycle, buy before booms, sell before slumps.", "words": [{"w": "Your", "f": 368, "e": 376}, {"w": "plan:", "f": 377, "e": 386}, {"w": "predict", "f": 387, "e": 399}, {"w": "the", "f": 400, "e": 406}, {"w": "business", "f": 407, "e": 421}, {"w": "cycle,", "f": 422, "e": 433}, {"w": "buy", "f": 434, "e": 440}, {"w": "before", "f": 441, "e": 452}, {"w": "booms,", "f": 452, "e": 463}, {"w": "sell", "f": 464, "e": 472}, {"w": "before", "f": 472, "e": 484}, {"w": "slumps.", "f": 484, "e": 497}]}, {"a": 505, "b": 643, "text": "Nineteen twenty-nine crashes, and the great forecaster never sees it coming.", "words": [{"w": "Nineteen", "f": 507, "e": 521}, {"w": "twenty-nine", "f": 522, "e": 541}, {"w": "crashes,", "f": 542, "e": 557}, {"w": "and", "f": 557, "e": 563}, {"w": "the", "f": 564, "e": 570}, {"w": "great", "f": 571, "e": 580}, {"w": "forecaster", "f": 581, "e": 599}, {"w": "never", "f": 599, "e": 609}, {"w": "sees", "f": 610, "e": 617}, {"w": "it", "f": 618, "e": 622}, {"w": "coming.", "f": 623, "e": 636}]}, {"a": 643, "b": 730, "text": "So what does a genius do when his genius fails?", "words": [{"w": "So", "f": 645, "e": 650}, {"w": "what", "f": 650, "e": 658}, {"w": "does", "f": 658, "e": 666}, {"w": "a", "f": 666, "e": 669}, {"w": "genius", "f": 670, "e": 680}, {"w": "do", "f": 681, "e": 685}, {"w": "when", "f": 686, "e": 693}, {"w": "his", "f": 694, "e": 700}, {"w": "genius", "f": 700, "e": 711}, {"w": "fails?", "f": 712, "e": 722}]}, {"a": 730, "b": 888, "text": "You see, it's like switching checkout lines. The moment you move, the old line speeds up.", "words": [{"w": "You", "f": 732, "e": 738}, {"w": "see,", "f": 738, "e": 746}, {"w": "it's", "f": 747, "e": 754}, {"w": "like", "f": 755, "e": 763}, {"w": "switching", "f": 763, "e": 779}, {"w": "checkout", "f": 780, "e": 794}, {"w": "lines.", "f": 795, "e": 806}, {"w": "The", "f": 806, "e": 812}, {"w": "moment", "f": 813, "e": 824}, {"w": "you", "f": 825, "e": 831}, {"w": "move,", "f": 831, "e": 840}, {"w": "the", "f": 841, "e": 847}, {"w": "old", "f": 848, "e": 854}, {"w": "line", "f": 854, "e": 862}, {"w": "speeds", "f": 863, "e": 874}, {"w": "up.", "f": 874, "e": 880}]}, {"a": 888, "b": 998, "text": "Keynes said most who try it sell too late and buy too late.", "words": [{"w": "Keynes", "f": 890, "e": 901}, {"w": "said", "f": 901, "e": 909}, {"w": "most", "f": 910, "e": 918}, {"w": "who", "f": 918, "e": 925}, {"w": "try", "f": 925, "e": 931}, {"w": "it", "f": 932, "e": 936}, {"w": "sell", "f": 937, "e": 945}, {"w": "too", "f": 946, "e": 952}, {"w": "late", "f": 952, "e": 960}, {"w": "and", "f": 961, "e": 967}, {"w": "buy", "f": 968, "e": 974}, {"w": "too", "f": 974, "e": 981}, {"w": "late.", "f": 981, "e": 991}]}, {"a": 998, "b": 1056, "text": "So he throws out the crystal ball.", "words": [{"w": "So", "f": 1000, "e": 1004}, {"w": "he", "f": 1004, "e": 1008}, {"w": "throws", "f": 1009, "e": 1018}, {"w": "out", "f": 1018, "e": 1024}, {"w": "the", "f": 1024, "e": 1029}, {"w": "crystal", "f": 1030, "e": 1040}, {"w": "ball.", "f": 1041, "e": 1049}]}, {"a": 1056, "b": 1152, "text": "He picks a few companies he understands and holds on.", "words": [{"w": "He", "f": 1058, "e": 1062}, {"w": "picks", "f": 1063, "e": 1072}, {"w": "a", "f": 1073, "e": 1075}, {"w": "few", "f": 1076, "e": 1082}, {"w": "companies", "f": 1082, "e": 1098}, {"w": "he", "f": 1099, "e": 1103}, {"w": "understands", "f": 1103, "e": 1122}, {"w": "and", "f": 1123, "e": 1129}, {"w": "holds", "f": 1129, "e": 1138}, {"w": "on.", "f": 1139, "e": 1145}]}, {"a": 1152, "b": 1232, "text": "Half an hour each morning, they say, still in bed.", "words": [{"w": "Half", "f": 1154, "e": 1160}, {"w": "an", "f": 1161, "e": 1165}, {"w": "hour", "f": 1165, "e": 1172}, {"w": "each", "f": 1172, "e": 1179}, {"w": "morning,", "f": 1179, "e": 1191}, {"w": "they", "f": 1192, "e": 1198}, {"w": "say,", "f": 1199, "e": 1205}, {"w": "still", "f": 1206, "e": 1213}, {"w": "in", "f": 1214, "e": 1217}, {"w": "bed.", "f": 1218, "e": 1224}]}, {"a": 1232, "b": 1348, "text": "Over a quarter century, his fund earns sixteen percent a year.", "words": [{"w": "Over", "f": 1234, "e": 1242}, {"w": "a", "f": 1242, "e": 1245}, {"w": "quarter", "f": 1246, "e": 1259}, {"w": "century,", "f": 1259, "e": 1274}, {"w": "his", "f": 1275, "e": 1281}, {"w": "fund", "f": 1282, "e": 1289}, {"w": "earns", "f": 1290, "e": 1300}, {"w": "sixteen", "f": 1300, "e": 1313}, {"w": "percent", "f": 1314, "e": 1327}, {"w": "a", "f": 1328, "e": 1330}, {"w": "year.", "f": 1331, "e": 1341}]}, {"a": 1348, "b": 1419, "text": "The British market: ten point four.", "words": [{"w": "The", "f": 1350, "e": 1356}, {"w": "British", "f": 1356, "e": 1368}, {"w": "market:", "f": 1369, "e": 1380}, {"w": "ten", "f": 1381, "e": 1386}, {"w": "point", "f": 1387, "e": 1396}, {"w": "four.", "f": 1396, "e": 1405}]}, {"a": 1419, "b": 1494, "text": "The man who explained the economy to the world", "words": [{"w": "The", "f": 1421, "e": 1427}, {"w": "man", "f": 1427, "e": 1433}, {"w": "who", "f": 1434, "e": 1439}, {"w": "explained", "f": 1440, "e": 1456}, {"w": "the", "f": 1456, "e": 1462}, {"w": "economy", "f": 1463, "e": 1475}, {"w": "to", "f": 1475, "e": 1480}, {"w": "the", "f": 1480, "e": 1486}, {"w": "world", "f": 1487, "e": 1496}]}, {"a": 1494, "b": 1575, "text": "beat the market from his pillow.", "words": [{"w": "beat", "f": 1496, "e": 1503}, {"w": "the", "f": 1504, "e": 1509}, {"w": "market", "f": 1510, "e": 1519}, {"w": "from", "f": 1520, "e": 1527}, {"w": "his", "f": 1527, "e": 1533}, {"w": "pillow.", "f": 1533, "e": 1544}]}]}